---
description: Feature implementation rules for OpenStack operators (tag-based)
alwaysApply: true
---

When implementing features for OpenStack operators, use the /feature
skill with a tag parameter (e.g., /feature tag=pqc).

Tag-specific knowledge is loaded from knowledge/feature-<tag>.md.
Follow the behavioral rules in workflows/feature/rules.md.

Available tags can be found by listing knowledge/feature-*.md files.

Key constraints:
- Never push or create PRs without user approval
- Always run full validation (tag Section 6) before delivery
- Always follow architecture patterns (tag Section 5)
- Check ticket status and tier before implementing
- Tier 1 (central) changes: defer to shared library team
